# A literal `~` directory in the repo root: an unexpanded home path someone
# created by accident (2026-07-03). It holds a copy of the operator's home
# directory - NTUSER.DAT, .ssh, .claude.json - and `git add -A` would otherwise
# stage all of it. The directory itself is the operator's to delete, not ours.
~/
